---
import HudMockup from "./HudMockup.astro";

// Two big cards showing live HUD scenarios, Cluely pattern
---

<section
  id="durante-a-reuniao"
  class="relative border-b border-paper/10"
  aria-labelledby="durante-titulo"
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-32 md:py-40">
    <div class="mb-16" data-reveal>
      <h2
        id="durante-titulo"
        class="font-display text-4xl font-black leading-tight text-paper md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl"
      >
        Durante a reunião
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-lg text-paper/70">
        Pitchei fica do seu lado nas conversas que importam. Ouve, entende e sugere em tempo real.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-12" data-reveal-stagger>
      {/* Card 1: Ouve a conversa */}
      <article class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-paper/10 bg-paper/[0.02] p-8 transition-all hover:bg-paper/[0.04] md:p-10">
        <div
          aria-hidden="true"
          class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-20 -top-20 h-64 w-64 rounded-full opacity-40 transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-60"
          style="background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(232,93,38,0.20) 0%, transparent 65%);"
        ></div>
        
        <div class="relative">
          <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-paper md:text-3xl">
            Ouve a conversa
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-base text-paper/65 md:text-lg">
            Transcreve o áudio da reunião em pt-BR com latência menor que 1 segundo. Entende sotaque, siglas e contexto técnico.
          </p>

          <div class="mt-8">
            <HudMockup class="max-w-md" />
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      {/* Card 2: Sugere o que dizer */}
      <article class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-paper/10 bg-paper/[0.02] p-8 transition-all hover:bg-paper/[0.04] md:p-10">
        <div
          aria-hidden="true"
          class="pointer-events-none absolute -left-20 -bottom-20 h-64 w-64 rounded-full opacity-40 transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-60"
          style="background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,179,71,0.16) 0%, transparent 65%);"
        ></div>
        
        <div class="relative">
          <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-paper md:text-3xl">
            Sugere o que dizer
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-base text-paper/65 md:text-lg">
            Quando o outro lado termina, Pitchei mostra uma sugestão glanceável. Você decide em meio segundo: usa, pede outra ou ignora.
          </p>

          <div class="mt-8">
            <div
              class="rounded-2xl border border-orange/45 p-6 shadow-[0_0_42px_rgba(232,93,38,0.12)]"
              style="background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(232,93,38,0.12), rgba(28,15,9,0.82));"
            >
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs">
                <span class="relative inline-flex h-2 w-2">
                  <span class="absolute inline-flex h-full w-full animate-pulse-soft rounded-full" style="background: #FF7A45"></span>
                  <span class="relative inline-flex h-2 w-2 rounded-full" style="background: #FF7A45"></span>
                </span>
                <span class="font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-orange">
                  Diga isso
                </span>
              </div>
              <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-relaxed text-paper md:text-lg">
                Faz sentido revisitar com base nos números que você mencionou antes de fecharmos?
              </p>
              <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                <span class="rounded-full bg-orange px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-paper">
                  Usar sugestão
                </span>
                <span class="rounded-full border border-paper/15 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-paper/80">
                  Outra
                </span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
